  ["**Guardrail**","Checks every input, output and tool call at runtime; can block","A security guard at the door who stops a bad answer leaving"],
  ["**AI Red Teaming Agent**","Generates attacks before release; reports attack success rate","A friendly burglar paid to test your locks"],
